{"parse": {"title": "NWE-06", "pageid": 69807, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-05\" title=\"NWE-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NWE-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-07\" title=\"NWE-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NWE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BE.8A.E5.9C.88.E4.B9.8B.E5.A4.96\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"羊圈之外\">羊圈之外</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 羊圈之外</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Discharge</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>咀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>嚼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>汁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>青<span class=\"color-value\"></span>草<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>狼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>篱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>二<span class=\"color-value\"></span>致<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191806</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wuguangchang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wuguangchang\"><img alt=\"wuguangchang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/Cg-wuguangchang.png/600px-Cg-wuguangchang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/Cg-wuguangchang.png/900px-Cg-wuguangchang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/Cg-wuguangchang.png/1200px-Cg-wuguangchang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雨雾遮盖了城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空旷而寒冷的广场上，行人们失去踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白伞之外，另一把黑伞格外显眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>在柏林的家族听到了你最新的消息。家族向你致以敬意，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>鉴于你晋升为了二级治疗师，并已经能全权负责人工梦游——我们赋予你家族会议的席位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚胸章递到了她的手心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>我们往第一防线学校投入了不少孩子，你是其中唯一能达到如今地位与成就的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>得益于此，圣洛夫基金会正在与家族进行第三次会谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>你的父母向我们传达了他们的骄傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那么——事务已经结束了。我可以走了，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把胸章放进口袋，没有看一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>别着急啊……我想就个人的身份跟你聊聊，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>个人身份是吗？那么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你打起官腔来让我感到恶心，哀歌。又或者，我应该叫你杰弗里·梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不过，看来你已经胜任了家族代理人这个职务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>家族在外的私生子，对规矩嗤之以鼻，逃到地下诊所的花花公子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>看来你“改邪归正”了，又或者是无路可走，回来摇尾乞怜了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>虽然我无权干涉家族的决议，但允许我为你能成为代理人保持一份怀疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>喔，呵呵，终于听到一些亲切的话了～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>我对你的刻薄有所耳闻，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我对你“改邪归正”的故事不感兴趣，也没有兴趣解答你的疑虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脚步不打算驻留，径直离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>那么……你对第十一届梅斯梅尔基金所资助的医学生感兴趣吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>我想想……根据资料，你们还做过一阵子同事，她叫——噢，我想起来了，多萝西娅？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>梅斯梅尔家族通过运作，让她通过了拉普拉斯科算中心的审核……我听说后来她死于一位发疯的病患手下，很遗憾……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……你多虑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>是吗？家族对此问题很是关切，因为这涉及到了基金会释放杰瑞·威尔逊的决策。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我对此并无疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只悬于头顶的庞大手掌，对她而言早已不陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>梅斯梅尔家族已经通过了慎重的决议，我想这并不容我们以自我狭窄的视野去议论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>那么……要是我告诉你，多萝西娅当初的加入就是为你如今的成就所铺路呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>虽然你所行经的道路产生了些许曲折的变化——但家族很幸运，你已经远超于他们对你的期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸上没有微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>当然，如果不是因为你，她也许不会殉职。说不定，直到现在她都是一个被蒙在鼓里的蠢蛋，在人类医院和厨房中度过一个无知却幸福的余生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>……真遗憾，小梅斯梅尔。决策总是伴随着牺牲——我对此深表哀悼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你到底想说什么……杰弗里·梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抓紧了伞柄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>但即便是一千个一万个多萝西娅的死，只要能成就一个这样的小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>那都是值得的，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他丢下了伞，任由雨滴淋在大衣上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>说到底，相比于我们家族所能拯救的人，一个她太渺小了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>真令人羡慕。相较起来，我可算是过惯了“最差解”。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>何况，她能参与到这场伟大的计划当中，已是万千受梅斯梅尔基金资助的孩子们所梦寐以求的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>你知道吗？像我这样的人类，总是会需要信仰些什么。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>她作为一个小小的砝码，已经物尽其用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>小梅斯梅尔，我希望你做个好梦。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伞遮住了她的面孔，却遮不住她不自禁后退的步伐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>你说呢？我很期待，也很乐意尊重你的想法，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一张渴盼的脸庞，仿若审讯官即将得到答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起了伞，露出了他意料之外的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>按照你的期望，我大概应该被你的话干扰，出现激烈的应激反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我应该像一只被踩了尾巴的小狗一样，歇斯底里，然后好让你为家族带去新的报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>哀歌……我们都是梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>审讯官的脸骤然冷了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我对梅斯梅尔家族会议的决策曾有所不满，这毋庸置疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但是，我们所崇尚的理性便意味着与这种情绪相抗衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>手术刀的用处，就是划出一道“伤口”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们都知道，希波克拉底誓言的时代已经过去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他眯着眼，饶有兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>你的神经质似乎有所好转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>这很好，很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他点燃了一只香烟，在雨水中，烟雾飘起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>……你知道他们为什么会让我，一个没有继承资格的私生子担任代理人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>因为一头离过群的羔羊，最明白其他的羊羔在想什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>那些虔诚的信徒，信仰最容易破裂；篱笆墙里最中心的孩子，最想知道外面的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>……我很高兴，说真的，小梅斯梅尔——家族里辈分最小的孩子，他人眼中的“掌上明珠”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>我很高兴，你现在站在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>能告诉我，多萝西娅最后跟你说了什么吗。我听说她在死前只给你留下了遗言？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>她没有说什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>呵……你似乎还是很珍视自己的小秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起伞，直视着哀歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不，我没有听清楚她说了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>当时她的喉咙已经被血呛住了，血液浸湿了我的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>她的嘴唇完全苍白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我把耳朵凑过去，但什么也没听清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那把刀已经深入到脖颈6公分的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我只听到迸溅出来的血在她的喉咙里吞咽，还有一呛一呛的咳嗽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我可以走了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-564001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哀歌：</div><div>请便。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>俯瞰之下，两柄圆伞在空旷的石砖上，各自往回挪移而去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宛如棋盘之上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第二次诊疗已然结束，但她们仍待在病房中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>所以……牙仙女士，那位名叫多萝西娅的医生最后去哪了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>我似乎没有在拉普拉斯康复中心见到她……她遗失了重要的东西，我想把这个还给她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抚摸着手里的书本，仍有些担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>铅玻璃小姐，我记得这位医生，这本书的主人已经不在世了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>把它留在这里吧。我想会有人处理的，我们该走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>等等，还请您再帮我一个忙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铅玻璃握紧了手中的物件。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔女士的办公室就在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>但我听说她今天休假了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>没关系……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铅玻璃的双手撑在轮椅上，正艰难地站起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在竭尽全力扬起身体后，铅玻璃张开了手心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-305312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-305312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-305312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>铅玻璃小姐，我可以替你递交给她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-303101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-303101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-303101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>不，谢谢你……只是，我想这样，小梅斯梅尔女士就不会再丢掉她了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-303113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-303113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-303113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>咳、咳……这样就可以了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她弯下腰，重新坐下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>我们回去吧，牙仙女士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛一切已尘埃落定，她们与来来往往的人群渐离渐远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孤零零的捕梦网悬挂在门把上，等待着它的主人归来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-564301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-564301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-564301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康复中心职员丹尼：</div><div>杰瑞·威尔逊对吗——你自由了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-564301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-564301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-564301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康复中心职员丹尼：</div><div>滚出拉普拉斯吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NWE-06"}}